{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e01-scene-12",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "我在飞机上已经看过了  (I Already Read It on the Plane)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "wang_er": "王尔",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "A week later, senior producer Xingzi summons the team to Chun Yuqiao's conference room. Wang Er tries to let Bu Xiaogu present her guest-star data, only for Chun Yuqiao to cut them short. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "王老师，二十二分钟之后总编室开会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "此外就是客座明星的人选问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "对手那边拼着命地跟我们抢人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这部分数据是实习助理布小谷做的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "我觉得还是让她来讲解一下比较好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "淳于总是睡着了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这样吧，还是由我来亲自讲。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "王总，开什么玩笑呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我在飞机上已经看过了，基本能过。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's step through the production meeting. Xingzi gives Wang Er a precise countdown.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "王老师，二十二分钟之后总编室开会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Teacher Wang, there is a meeting in the chief editor's office in twenty-two minutes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "此外就是客座明星的人选问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Besides that, there is the question of choosing the guest star.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "对手那边拼着命地跟我们抢人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The rival network is fighting tooth and nail with us to snap up talent.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这部分数据是实习助理布小谷做的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This section of data was prepared by intern assistant Bu Xiaogu.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "我觉得还是让她来讲解一下比较好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I think it would be better to have her explain it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "淳于总是睡着了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Has Director Chun Yu fallen asleep?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这样吧，还是由我来亲自讲。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How about this — let me explain it myself instead.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "王总，开什么玩笑呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director Wang, what kind of joke is this?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我在飞机上已经看过了，基本能过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I already read it on the plane; overall it passes.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "王老师，二十二分钟之后总编室开会。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "此外就是客座明星的人选问题。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "对手那边拼着命地跟我们抢人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这部分数据是实习助理布小谷做的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "我觉得还是让她来讲解一下比较好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "淳于总是睡着了吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "这样吧，还是由我来亲自讲。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "王总，开什么玩笑呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我在飞机上已经看过了，基本能过。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Chun Yuqiao was wide awake the entire time — and he is far from pleased to see an untrained intern in his meeting. You heard \"zhihou\" for \"after\", \"wo juede\", and \"kai wanxiao\".",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
